2026-11-06 * "Sell USD-costed lot for GBP proceeds"
  Assets:Broker                    -1 ACME {}
  Assets:Cash                       8 GBP
  choose account {
    when context is reduction and direction is debit: Income:Capital-Gains:Losses,
    when context is reduction and direction is credit: Income:Capital-Gains,
    when context is aggregate: Income:Proceeds-Other-Currency
  }

